OL,3,A'Everything is under mud': Nepal death
OL,4,Atoll rises to 389 amid fears of new
OL,5,Aflood
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Nepalese man living in Aberdeen tells
OL,8,Fthe BBC how he lost three close family
OL,9,Fmembers in the flash floods
OL,11,FAnother man from East London says his
OL,12,Fsister was "really excited" to go on
OL,13,Fher first pilgrimage, but has now been
OL,14,Fout of contact
OL,16,FThe glacial collapse that is said to
OL,17,Fhave caused the flash floods happened
OL,18,Fon the Nepal side of the Himalayan
OL,19,Fmountains, Nepalese officials tell the
OL,20,FBBC
